{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_040tam0263_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_040tam0263_1000_p", "source_sha256": "8637580b52820974ddaa52370014c1a24d342cc7cfffd1d7deef06aa652f1575", "ja": "（グラビア雑誌『アイグラ！！』の撮影が進んでいる。\n今日も環は元気いっぱいだ！）", "zh": "（照片杂志《偶像写真！！》的拍摄正在进行。\n今天环也依旧活力十足！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_040tam0263_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_040tam0263_1001_040tam", "source_sha256": "04a15dedd296138de4153a05b33594d43432b113a0011a487e6823b3d27f24df", "ja": "おやぶん、おやぶん！\nたまきの撮影、どうだった？", "zh": "老大，老大！\n环的拍摄怎么样？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_040tam0263_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_040tam0263_1002_p", "source_sha256": "4ebda57fcaa71e80c064d60553bd44f02e6dc4cd91ca5f771b8a11681dc322be", "ja": "ああ、いい感じだぞ。\nパジャマもよく似合ってるな。", "zh": "啊，感觉很不错。\n你穿睡衣也很合适嘛。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_040tam0263_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_040tam0263_1003_040tam", "source_sha256": "220e59e7d92b59cebf63f6aa02a02b9b099c45bd06120aa42e6d0afe861d102e", "ja": "くふふ、ありがとう！　なんだかウサギさんみたいで、\nたまきもすっごく気に入ってるんだ♪", "zh": "嘿嘿，谢谢！感觉就像小兔子一样，环也特别喜欢呢♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_040tam0263_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_040tam0263_1004_p", "source_sha256": "18dfb1becfe70d5e767e520685683f034af9c449dad6d246fff3b46e80319992", "ja": "確かに。小動物みたいで可愛いな。", "zh": "确实。像小动物一样，很可爱呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_040tam0263_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_040tam0263_1005_henshusya", "source_sha256": "c7944387541484becedf51054208fd5abe081a74be6bb561523bcfb0850afa66", "ja": "お話中、すみません。\n今後の予定について、お時間よろしいですか？", "zh": "抱歉，打扰一下。\n现在方便聊聊今后的安排吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_040tam0263_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_040tam0263_1006_p", "source_sha256": "3c7f932ac3d0ffb5d13cfdd4d39cd43f61285141ca85eb2750077e60b6590332", "ja": "はい、大丈夫です！　……環、ごめんな。\nちょっと行ってくるから、休んでてくれ。", "zh": "好的，没问题！……环，对不起。\n我先离开一下，你休息吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_040tam0263_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_040tam0263_1007_040tam", "source_sha256": "5b06e543f41e6d49e9df566617f8b59204ae228ecb48cda5936acf2d1974cab1", "ja": "うん、わかった！\nいってらっしゃい、おやぶん！", "zh": "嗯，知道了！\n路上小心，老大！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_040tam0263_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_040tam0263_1008_p", "source_sha256": "6c5d6045c38a5fec60be6db7f56db330022682434e8e16cfa46d98c853b54e1d", "ja": "（打ち合わせが思ったより長引いたな。\nそろそろ撮影が再開する時間だけど、環は……）", "zh": "（商量比想象中拖得久啊。\n差不多该到重新开始拍摄的时间了，环她……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_040tam0263_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_040tam0263_1009_040tam", "source_sha256": "a26c4a3143ee8eccf80c0a054a5f0d0bdc952a12d2df8bf031b795d7686124b7", "ja": "スー……スー……。\nキリンさん……むにゃ……。", "zh": "呼……呼……。\n长颈鹿……呼噜……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_040tam0263_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_040tam0263_1010_p", "source_sha256": "650c0d6cb786f02d430a8739d007d834ab481e9e5b2b68f10db67f7007c26a9b", "ja": "セットのベッドで寝てる……。\n前半の撮影でたくさん動いてたもんな。", "zh": "睡在布景的床上……  \n前半的拍摄一直动来动去，肯定累坏了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_040tam0263_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_040tam0263_1011_p", "source_sha256": "b3114ab08499c414477327e5f29112b9268e220d62b391f2eb4fbeea7116d3ca", "ja": "寝かせてやりたいけど、予定もあるし……。\n環、起きてくれ。撮影がはじまるぞ。", "zh": "真想让她再睡会儿，但后面还有预定行程……\n环，醒醒啦。拍摄要开始了哦。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_040tam0263_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_040tam0263_1012_040tam", "source_sha256": "4145d8a81e0d290b7013658c0644453ab70557c89671d2f0de05209928e12c6b", "ja": "ん……おやぶん……？\nあれっ？　たまき、寝ちゃってた？", "zh": "嗯……老大……？\n咦？环刚才睡着了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_040tam0263_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_040tam0263_1013_p", "source_sha256": "a84d3bf311d30206b5c244a162a5ec8f7dbd7e97583ded0f589f46e48a35bce9", "ja": "ああ。気持ちよさそうに寝てたけど、\nいい夢でも見てたのか？", "zh": "嗯。你睡得很香啊，是做了什么美梦吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_040tam0263_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_040tam0263_1014_040tam", "source_sha256": "52b259964deebd7c1a143124f9cb7fcb7c3982982d69813d342fe032867ca4e9", "ja": "うん！　たまき、たくさんの動物と一緒に\nパジャマでパーティーしてたんだ♪", "zh": "嗯！环和好多动物一起穿着睡衣开派对来着♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_040tam0263_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_040tam0263_1015_040tam", "source_sha256": "4a756c082ab348cc7850e839272624bc95550571248180c518262c46cec92351", "ja": "お菓子食べたり、お話したり、とっても楽しかったぞ！\nきっと、このパジャマのおかげだね！", "zh": "吃点心、聊聊天，可开心了！\n一定是多亏了这身睡衣吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_040tam0263_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_040tam0263_1016_p", "source_sha256": "9fd640ed6d05aa96f61644a40e5b278bd3deadddd2aabb5740d7fbd959cddf89", "ja": "なるほど、それで「キリン」って寝言を……。\nそれにしても、楽しそうな夢だったんだな。", "zh": "原来如此，所以才会说梦话“长颈鹿”啊……\n话说回来，看来是个很开心的梦呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_040tam0263_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_040tam0263_1017_040tam", "source_sha256": "cac85b4b0b768078c7a2daccc2640ee5878a1c0c38d2e3a9fdec3bf9dfec9edd", "ja": "うん♪　たまき、キリンさんにね、\n「寝る時は長い首どうするの？」って聞いたんだ。", "zh": "嗯♪环去问了长颈鹿先生，\n“睡觉的时候长脖子要怎么办呀？”哦。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_040tam0263_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_040tam0263_1018_040tam", "source_sha256": "b3f967cce66cbfe40738af7bc0b6e2a243fd34bab119b0b331d46e3e280e2ed5", "ja": "でも、キリンさんが答える前に起きちゃった……。\nううっ……なんだかモヤモヤするぞ。", "zh": "可是，在长颈鹿回答之前就醒了……呜呜……总觉得心里闷闷的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_040tam0263_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_040tam0263_1019_p", "source_sha256": "0d7f2640e51f367cf50ca014b369b1772c7a681d7b972cffacce8f75b01a7986", "ja": "そ、そうか。変なところで起こしちゃったな……。\n撮影が終わるまでに、答え調べとくよ。", "zh": "这、这样啊。偏偏在奇怪的地方把你弄醒了……\n我会在拍摄结束前查好答案的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_040tam0263_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_040tam0263_1020_040tam", "source_sha256": "f720f8e07af9de1119289a7cab704e7403b46b4e9ab7f12d6d4971c5e615b99f", "ja": "ほんと！？　ありがと、おやぶん！　キリンさん、\nどんな風に寝てるんだろう……楽しみだな～♪", "zh": "真的！？谢谢你，头儿！长颈鹿，\n到底是怎么睡觉的呢……好期待啊～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
